    "statement": "For every live Shape-A rank (e+1)/2<=r<=e-1, the syzygy-bundle counts are uniquely c_1=2r-e, c_2=e-r-1, c_3=0, so E=O(-1)^(2r-e) direct_sum O(-2)^(e-r-1) and S_1V=S_(e-1). This follows because the inverse prolongation J injects into the kernel of a small-class coordinate projection of the restricted Koszul kernel, while locator interpolation makes that projection have rank at least r-1. Equality also forces each small-class interpolation map to have exact rank r-1. Its unique left-kernel form B_gamma in the common domain coefficient space obeys B_gamma(x)=kappa_gamma eta_x L_U0'(x)^2/L_Mgamma'(x)=kappa_gamma eta_x L_Mgamma'(x)L_rest,gamma(x)^2 at every x in M_gamma, and is nonzero there.",
